---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: All Cars
description: "Every BMW and Porsche covered on ZRG Classics, from the E28 to the 991: common issues, repair costs, guides, torque specs, and buyer's guides."
breadcrumbs:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Cars" }
---
{% include "partials/breadcrumb.njk" %}

<main class="resource-content cars-index">
    <div class="page-intro">
        <h1>The Cars</h1>
        <p class="page-lede">{{ stats.vehicles }} platforms so far. Each one has its known problems and what they cost to fix, step-by-step guides, torque specs, where to buy parts, and a buyer's guide.</p>
    </div>

    {% asyncEach brand in [["bmw", "BMW"], ["porsche", "Porsche"]] %}
    <section class="brand-block">
        <div class="brand-header">
            <h2 class="brand-title">{{ brand[1] }}</h2>
            <a href="/resources/{{ brand[0] }}/" class="brand-link">{{ brand[1] }} overview →</a>
        </div>
        {% set brandKey = brand[0] %}
        {% include "partials/vehicle-grid.njk" %}
    </section>
    {% endeach %}
</main>
